    <item>
      <title>核心网页指标与优化顺序</title>
      <link>https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>LCP、INP、CLS 三个指标分别衡量加载、交互与视觉稳定。本文给出各自的阈值、最常见成因，以及按投入产出排序的优化动作。</description>
      <category>前端工程</category>
      <category>性能优化</category>
      <category>性能</category>
      <category>LCP</category>
      <category>INP</category>
      <category>CLS</category>
      <category>前端</category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p style="margin:0 0 14px"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#0071e3;color:#ffffff;font:600 12px/1.7 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.02em">OpenRef OFFICIAL</span></p><nav class="feed-toc"><strong>本页内容</strong><ul><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/#适用场景">适用场景</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/#阈值">阈值</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/#最小示例">最小示例</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/#说明">说明</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/#限制">限制</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/frontend/performance/core-web-vitals/#下一步">下一步</a></li></ul></nav><div class="feed-content"><p>核心网页指标（Core Web Vitals）是三量化用户体验的指标，按「75 百分位用户达到」为通过标准。优化前先确认是哪一个不达标，三者的成因与解法几乎不重叠。</p>
<h2 id="适用场景">适用场景</h2>
<ul><li>页面体验报告或 Lighthouse 显示指标未达标</li><li>上线前的性能验收</li><li>移动端加载或卡顿的归因分析</li></ul>
<h2 id="阈值">阈值</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>含义</th><th>良好</th><th>需改进</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>LCP</td><td>最大内容绘制完成时间</td><td>≤ 2.5 s</td><td>&gt; 4 s</td></tr><tr><td>INP</td><td>交互到下一次绘制的延迟</td><td>≤ 200 ms</td><td>&gt; 500 ms</td></tr><tr><td>CLS</td><td>累计布局偏移</td><td>≤ 0.1</td><td>&gt; 0.25</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2 id="最小示例">最小示例</h2>
<p>为图片预留空间并优先加载首屏图：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="html">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">html</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line">&lt;img src=<span class="tok-s">&quot;/hero.webp&quot;</span> width=<span class="tok-s">&quot;1200&quot;</span> height=<span class="tok-s">&quot;600&quot;</span> fetchpriority=<span class="tok-s">&quot;high&quot;</span> alt=<span class="tok-s">&quot;示意图&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<p>拆分长任务，避免单次执行阻塞主线程：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="js">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">js</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">async</span> <span class="tok-k">function</span> <span class="tok-f">processAll</span>(items) {</span><span class="code-line">  <span class="tok-k">for</span> (<span class="tok-k">const</span> item <span class="tok-k">of</span> items) {</span><span class="code-line">    <span class="tok-f">doWork</span>(item);</span><span class="code-line">    <span class="tok-c">// 让出主线程，使浏览器能响应输入</span></span><span class="code-line">    <span class="tok-k">await</span> <span class="tok-k">new</span> <span class="tok-f">Promise</span>((r) =&gt; <span class="tok-f">setTimeout</span>(r, <span class="tok-n">0</span>));</span><span class="code-line">  }</span><span class="code-line">}</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<h2 id="说明">说明</h2>
<ul><li><strong>LCP</strong> 通常由首屏图片、字体或渲染阻塞脚本决定。给 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 写死 <code>width</code>/<code>height</code>，避免用 JS 决定尺寸。</li><li><strong>INP</strong> 差几乎都源于主线程长任务。把大循环切片、把计算移入 Web Worker、减少事件回调里的同步布局读取。</li><li><strong>CLS</strong> 的成因是尺寸未知的元素：无尺寸图片、动态插入的广告位、晚加载的字体导致重排。用 <code>min-height</code> 或 <code>font-display: optional</code> 规避。</li><li>字体与关键 CSS 内联，非关键 JS 用 <code>defer</code>，能让 LCP 提前。</li></ul>
<h2 id="限制">限制</h2>
<ul><li>指标取自真实用户数据（CrUX），本地 Lighthouse 分数不能直接代表线上结果。</li><li>单页内 LCP 元素可能变化（如轮播图），需以实际监测为准。</li><li>优化动作互相牵制：预加载过多资源会改善 LCP 但拖慢 INP。</li></ul>
<h2 id="下一步">下一步</h2>
<ul><li><a href="/docs/frontend/seo/technical-seo-checklist/">技术 SEO 检查清单</a></li><li><a href="/docs/programming/javascript/abort-controller/">AbortController 取消请求</a></li></ul></div>]]></content:encoded>
